# Build outputs from the host must never enter the image build context:
# obj/project.assets.json points at host-specific NuGet folders and breaks `dotnet publish --no-restore`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/.vs/

# Not needed to build the API image
.git/
.github/
tests/
web/
docs/
deploy/
state/
*.md
.env
.env.*
compose*.yaml

# Tooling caches
graft/
.claude/
